WEBVTT

00:01:57.822 --> 00:02:00.825
to produce that much amount
of usable material.

00:02:03.411 --> 00:02:06.289
Our ticket to green growth,
in other words,

00:02:06.289 --> 00:02:08.624
is digging deep in the environment.

00:02:10.793 --> 00:02:13.212
Now we know that mining
can have grave impacts

00:02:13.254 --> 00:02:15.673
for local ecosystems and populations.

00:02:15.673 --> 00:02:18.551
I’ve seen it myself,
and it really isn’t pretty.

00:02:19.051 --> 00:02:20.761
But what I want to talk about today

00:02:20.761 --> 00:02:23.806
is about how much and where
we’re going to have to dig,

00:02:23.848 --> 00:02:27.518
and what that means for planetary
security and for geopolitics.

00:02:27.894 --> 00:02:29.228
I'll start from there.

00:02:29.896 --> 00:02:31.063
History tells us